  "description": "\u201cTo construct, in a given rectilineal angle, a parallelogram equal to a given triangle.\u201d\n\u2014 Euclid's Elements, BOOK I \u2022 PROP. 42 (G.71)\n\n00:00 1 \u00b7 GIVEN: \u27e8 A B C \u27e9, \u27e8 D )\n00:17 2 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: bisect_segment(/ B C /) \u2192 E (/ B E / = / E C /), segment(A, E) \u2192 / A E /\n00:24 3 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: copy_angle(/ E C /, E, \u27e8 D )) \u2192 \u27e8 C E F ) (\u27e8 C E F ) = \u27e8 D ))\n00:31 4 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: parallel_line(A, / E C /) \u2192 / A G /, parallel_line(C, / E F /) \u2192 / C G / \u2192 \u27e8 F E C G \u27e9\n00:38 5 \u00b7 ASSERT: / B E / = / E C /, / B C / \u2225 / A G / \u2192 \u27e8 A B E \u27e9 = \u27e8 A E C \u27e9 \u2192 \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = 2 \u27e8 A E C \u27e9\n00:52 6 \u00b7 ASSERT: / E C / \u2225 / A G / \u2192 \u27e8 F E C G \u27e9 = 2 \u27e8 A E C \u27e9\n01:05 7 \u00b7 \u2234: \u27e8 F E C G \u27e9 = \u27e8 A B C \u27e9, \u27e8 C E F ) = \u27e8 D )\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 G.71 \u2022 v2",
